%% Run sequence - prompt to terminal run, offline/mock provider path (no live paid API)
%% Source: UI-COMMANDS-v1 sections 2-3, blueprint Phase 4/5/6/9
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as UI_composer_S03
    participant WS as axum_ws
    participant BUS as Command_bus
    participant RUN as Run_manager
    participant SCH as Scheduler_caps
    participant PRV as Provider_client
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant EVB as Event_fanout

    U->>UI: type prompt then Enter
    UI->>WS: SUBMIT_PROMPT text project_id correlation_id
    WS->>BUS: validate envelope and schema
    alt invalid payload
        BUS-->>WS: ERROR E_SCHEMA_INVALID or E_PROMPT_EMPTY
        WS-->>UI: ERROR frame to refusal toast S14
    else valid
        BUS->>DB: INSERT run status queued
        BUS-->>WS: ACK and RUN_CREATED
        WS-->>UI: ACK and RUN_CREATED
        BUS->>RUN: plan DAG one provider call per plan
        RUN->>PRV: pre-send Decimal budget preflight
        alt budget exceeded
            PRV-->>RUN: E_BUDGET_EXCEEDED provider call count 0
            RUN->>DB: run row failed INCOMPLETE cost NULL not zero
            EVB-->>UI: RUN_STATUS failed and ERROR
        else budget allowed
            RUN->>SCH: dispatch tasks depth lt 3 fanout lt 8
            SCH->>PRV: POST chat completions wiremock tests or live with approval
            PRV-->>SCH: response and usage prompt completion tokens
            SCH->>EVB: NODE_STATE and RUN_METRICS
            EVB-->>WS: diff broadcast frames seq monotonic
            WS-->>UI: NODE_STATE and RUN_METRICS render-back
            RUN->>DB: persist usage and Decimal cost
            RUN->>EVB: REPLY_DELTA stream
            EVB-->>UI: progressive streamed reply S27
            RUN->>DB: terminal run row completed and snapshot revision
            RUN->>EVB: REPLY_DONE and RUN_STATUS completed
            EVB-->>UI: terminal state thinking cleared
        end
    end
    Note over SCH,PRV: failure path 429 401 402 timeout maps to a named E_PROVIDER refusal, run failed, partial state preserved
    Note over WS,EVB: reconnect sends hello last_seq and stale expected_rev returns E_RESYNC_REQUIRED
